# ADR-001: Pipeline vs Supervisor

Date: 2026-10-24
Status: Accepted

## Context
Need 4 agents: Extractor, Comparator, Risk Scorer, Memo Writer. How to orchestrate?

## Options
1. Pipeline (fixed sequential)
2. Supervisor (LLM decides next agent)

## Decision
Pipeline.

## Reason
- Fixed order: extract -> compare -> score -> memo. No dynamic routing needed.
- Supervisor adds 1 extra LLM call = more cost > Rs25 and latency >3min - fails NFR.
- Pipeline easy to log trace_id and cite clause number + playbook ID.
- Security: planted instruction cannot hijack supervisor to skip steps.

## Consequences
+ Deterministic, cheap, testable
- Less flexible for parallel processing (can add later)